  "description": "20-year-old Ji-Won, who has lived without any presence. He plans to end his life on his birthday. However, his life is turned upside down due to an alt-character he created by chance, and in real life, ‘Ahsa’ Lim Ji-Won ends up living as the alt-character ‘Insa’ Kim Si-Hoo. As Ji-Won becomes more and more immersed in the life of the alt-character, he loses his sense of existence, and eventually decides to kill the alt-character... Will he be able to leave behind everything he gained as an alt-character and return to himself?\n\n(Naver, translated)",
